menu "Container NVS"

config CONTAINER_NVS_PARTITION
    string "NVS partition label used by container_nvs"
    default "nvs"
    help
        Label of the NVS partition where container_nvs stores its key/value
        blobs. "nvs" is the standard partition present in the default partition
        table, so the library works out of the box. Point it at a dedicated
        partition if you want this storage isolated (e.g. a Matter/CHIP factory
        namespace partition).

endmenu
